  "_comment": "Dispatch round 4 (confirm-B2 N1). Needs CHIRPSTACK_APP_FIELD_TESTER=synthetic-field-tester-app on both sides: record with OSI_ORACLE_NODE=edge/harness/scenarios/dispatch/oracle-fieldtester-node.sh and replay Go through a wrapper that runs `exec env CHIRPSTACK_APP_FIELD_TESTER=synthetic-field-tester-app <osi-edge> \"$@\"`. Process STREGA and the KIWI storage node skip an uplink from the field-tester application (applicationId trimmed and lower-cased) before their writes; Process STREGA's in-memory dedup and the KIWI uplink key drop a repeat of the same deduplicationId; later reports are processed.",
